    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echoes from Liminality</strong> is a first-person narrative exploration game that draws you into <i>The Threshold</i>, a strange and haunting dimension filled with echoes of the past and fragments of a life left behind. Guided by ambient soundscapes and emotionally driven puzzles, you\u2019ll navigate uncanny environments, uncover long-buried secrets, and piece together a story that blurs the line between memory and dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step you take in this surreal world is accompanied by an evocative soundtrack that is crucial to both gameplay and storytelling. Music becomes your guide as it reveals hidden clues, triggers emotional shifts, and helps you piece together the fragmented past. It is not only the key to unraveling the mysteries of the past, but the very path that leads you toward healing and self-discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of the mystery lies a missing father and the unanswered question of why he vanished. As you navigate <i>The Threshold</i>, you\u2019ll confront not just the disappearance of your father, but the deeper layers of loss, identity, and connection that bind you to him. The world is alive with echoes from the past, and the choices you make will uncover the truth behind the enigmatic secrets that haunt your family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echoes from Liminality</strong> is not just a journey through a mysterious world, but a deeply emotional story about grief, identity, and the bonds that connect us across time and space. Prepare to step into a place that exists just outside reality\u2026 and ask yourself if you\u2019re truly ready to confront what\u2019s been left behind.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echoes from Liminality</strong> is a first-person narrative exploration game that draws you into <i>The Threshold</i>, a strange and haunting dimension filled with echoes of the past and fragments of a life left behind. Guided by ambient soundscapes and emotionally driven puzzles, you\u2019ll navigate uncanny environments, uncover long-buried secrets, and piece together a story that blurs the line between memory and dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step you take in this surreal world is accompanied by an evocative soundtrack that is crucial to both gameplay and storytelling. Music becomes your guide as it reveals hidden clues, triggers emotional shifts, and helps you piece together the fragmented past. It is not only the key to unraveling the mysteries of the past, but the very path that leads you toward healing and self-discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of the mystery lies a missing father and the unanswered question of why he vanished. As you navigate <i>The Threshold</i>, you\u2019ll confront not just the disappearance of your father, but the deeper layers of loss, identity, and connection that bind you to him. The world is alive with echoes from the past, and the choices you make will uncover the truth behind the enigmatic secrets that haunt your family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echoes from Liminality</strong> is not just a journey through a mysterious world, but a deeply emotional story about grief, identity, and the bonds that connect us across time and space. Prepare to step into a place that exists just outside reality\u2026 and ask yourself if you\u2019re truly ready to confront what\u2019s been left behind.</p>",
    "short_description": "Wander in the Threshold, where your memories are the key. Can you face what still lingers ? An emotional story-driven exploration game in eerie liminal spaces.",
